      "created_at": "2023-09-19T15:10:15.888Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I’m not even going to list out expected recording schedule this time as it will be off for the next couple months</p>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-71\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-71\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/9a9dbe46c644d40585f2b2c15b4093a02ea2bdf1.png\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-71\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Letters Page: Editor's Note #71</a></h3>\n\n  <p>We were live again! And we reveal so much! Show Notes: Run Time: 1:22:05 Some introductions, but then, a DOUBLE SCHEDULE?! You better believe it! Upcoming schedule:    Tuesday, October 3rd: Episode #262: Robert Johnson vs the Headless Horseman  ...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>Upcoming October and November schedule:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Tuesday, October 3rd: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#262:</span> Robert Johnson vs the Headless Horseman</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Tuesday, October 10th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#263:</span> General Geist Returns</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Tuesday, October 17th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#264:</span> Werewolf Haka</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Tuesday, October 24th: Editor’s Note <span class=\"hashtag\">#72</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Tuesday, October 31st: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#265:</span> Guise fights the Draculas</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Tuesday, November 7th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#266:</span> GloomWeaver vs. Æternus</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Tuesday, November 14th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#267:</span> Prime Wardens in the Egyptian Underworld</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Tuesday, November 21st: Editor’s Note <span class=\"hashtag\">#73</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Tuesday, November 28th: Episode <span class=\"hashtag\">#268:</span> Grimm: Lord of the Harvest</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
