      "created_at": "2023-09-19T21:36:10.553Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I wonder if anyone’s found that image of moon wolves Adam was talking about.</p>\n<p>“The Enclave of the Hippies” just doesn’t have the same ring to it :V</p>\n<p>We need more detailed descriptions of fake movie scenes. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>I am pleased to say I am one of the 12 who voted for Mocktriarch, admittedly before it was revealed as a dupe. XD</p>\n<p>Hey, more fake movies, all right!</p>\n<p>Adam’s “eww” at the LP art being a decade old is a big mood.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Jeysie\" data-post=\"4\" data-topic=\"30248\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/48/1868_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Jeysie:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>FWIW I submitted it phrased that way two years ago before we knew about Rambler and it didn’t get enough votes the first time.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Oh! Awesome, I had just submitted Rambler vs. the HH for this month, I was really glad to see it got in, no matter what he’s called <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
