      "id": 265045,
      "name": "",
      "username": "LonelyMan",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2026-02-05T16:49:59.749Z",
      "cooked": "<p>They can’t do Mother Goose and Grimm, that’s already a thing.  A comics thing, even.</p>\n<p>Memory … spotty!  Too…many…things!  Nothing shortens like Shatnering.</p>\n<p>Christopher will have traveled the world, but will he be a world traveler?</p>\n<p>The werewolf shirt joke doesn’t sound as funny as all that…I think it should have been a werewolf tearing open his shirt and yelling something like “I AM SECRETLY APOSTATE!!!”</p>\n<p>The Firth of Fourth is apparently a thing that happened here…</p>\n<p>I wonder how scary they could have possibly gotten for Halloween, without ceasing to be PG rated as a podcast.</p>",
      "post_number": 12,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2026-02-05T17:28:20.356Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
