      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "They can't do Mother Goose and Grimm, that's already a thing.  A comics thing, even.\n\nMemory .... spotty!  Too....many...things!  Nothing shortens like Shatnering.\n\nChristopher will have traveled the world, but will he be a world traveler?\n\nThe werewolf shirt joke doesn't sound as funny as all that...I think it should have been a werewolf tearing open his shirt and yelling something like \"I AM SECRETLY APOSTATE!!!\"\n\nThe Firth of Fourth is apparently a thing that happened here....\n\nI wonder how scary they could have possibly gotten for Halloween, without ceasing to be PG rated as a podcast.",
